Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=59}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:59.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain! Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.09,0:02:05.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NAMI]\NOne tooth\Nis the size of our boat!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.39,0:02:06.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.18,0:02:07.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.31,0:02:08.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no monster.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.16,0:02:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This is a one big stupid dream that we're\Nall having together for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:13.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A dream! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:16.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NYou know...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.11,0:02:20.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our boys just got eaten.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.45,0:02:27.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So did that ship we\Nwere trying to salvage.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.11,0:02:29.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you be so calm?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep. Most definitely eaten.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.75,0:02:37.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can see the air hoses\Ndangling from its jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:46.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A sea monster\Nate my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:51.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.82,0:02:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.28,0:02:54.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Nsaid it would be safe
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.61,0:02:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at the bottom of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know, what qualifies\Nfor "safe" in your book,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.16,0:03:01.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but in mine it's not\Nman‐eating turtles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:03.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:06.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.65,0:03:10.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's as good as\Nit's going to get, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't cut the air hoses,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.00,0:03:26.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that beast will drag us down\Nto the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:27.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.26,0:03:29.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you do,\Njust do something.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the tough and smart lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.22,0:03:32.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NGive me a minute.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.05,0:03:33.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll see what\NI can come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLUE SHIRT]\NOkay, boys!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.61,0:03:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to save our noble captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.65,0:03:44.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our pride, honor,\Nand lives are at stake here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.11,0:03:47.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLUE SHIRT]\NOur captain\Nis alive and we will find him!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.57,0:03:49.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mark my words!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.50,0:03:50.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.49,0:03:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's these challenging times\Nthat prove the strength
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by which we are made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.30,0:03:59.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cut the air hoses,\Nand get us out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThis is what we're made of?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NCoward!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.10,0:04:09.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like everything got dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! Scary.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.44,0:04:15.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.61,0:04:16.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why is it so dark?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not that late.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time to leave guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:24.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.71,0:04:26.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B]\NThis is a bad omen.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.87,0:04:29.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We all know the suddenly\Ndarkened sun is the harbinger
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.42,0:04:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the monsters to soon rise.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE C]\NWe gotta save\Nthe boss and get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.60,0:04:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Tell me what happened! Are you\Ndead?! Where're the others?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.26,0:04:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NZoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.43,0:04:49.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSet sail now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.47,0:04:50.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gotta get outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYeah. That guy's crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.68,0:04:54.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now let's get away
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.60,0:04:57.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from this stinking turtle\Nas fast as we can!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.23,0:04:58.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't a turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a monkey.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.57,0:05:01.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a bona fide sea monkey.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.67,0:05:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't say I'm too surprised\Nthat he and Luffy
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.34,0:05:05.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,got along as well as they did.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well they're both monkeys!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.34,0:05:08.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But when he caught a\Nglimpse of all this stuff
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that we had taken from his\Nship, he totally flipped out
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and went on a rampage.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.36,0:05:15.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a primate\Nact like that before.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.41,0:05:17.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Masira,\Nthe King of All Salvagers.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.75,0:05:18.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But never mind him,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,how did the three of you escape\Nfrom the giant sea turtle?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NUgh! Why do you\Nkeep talking about a turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:24.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHmm. That's weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.27,0:05:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now he's just floating\Nthere like a statue,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with his mouth gaping open.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.35,0:05:33.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh I get it. Of course!\NThat's how you guys escaped!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.27,0:05:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO, SANJI]\N– We were in that thing's mouth??\N– We were in that thing's mouth??
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.79,0:05:37.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NNothing gets\Npast you guys does it?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.58,0:05:40.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the turtle that ate\Nthe ship you were inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[coughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.75,0:05:46.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. When did night happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Attention, all hands!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.30,0:05:50.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're getting outta here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.72,0:05:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hand over the\Ntreasure you stole.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.77,0:06:03.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or I'll tear your ship apart\Nand find all of it anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is he right?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.25,0:06:05.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys found some treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:08.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NWe sure did. Tons of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.72,0:06:09.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis isn't good.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.76,0:06:13.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If he starts rampaging\Nthe ship, we all go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:19.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain, behind you!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.15,0:06:21.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MASIRA]\NHmm? What's behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(734,1053)}– Sea monsters!\N– Sea monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.65,0:07:49.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat couldn't have been real.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.74,0:07:54.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThose things\Nwere taller than the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is\Nan endless parade
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.43,0:08:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of mysteries and annoyance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:04.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at the nightmare\Nof just making it through today.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.19,0:08:05.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First there was that\Na huge galleon that fell
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from the clouds on top of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose's needle\Nstarted pointing to the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.26,0:08:13.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A psycho make‐up\Nwearing monkey shows up
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and blocks our way.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.66,0:08:17.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then,\Na gigantic sea turtle came
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and ate our salvage ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.21,0:08:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then darkness fell.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.21,0:08:22.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because the biggest\Nmonsters I've ever seen
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.88,0:08:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in my life blocked out the sun.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.01,0:08:28.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must admit, even I was\Nintimidated by those things.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.55,0:08:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThose monsters were too\Nbig for any of us to take them.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.72,0:08:43.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYeah. If I never see them again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it would be a blessing.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.65,0:08:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.99,0:08:50.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'd really cut loose,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could've taught those\Nsea monsters a thing or two.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.95,0:08:54.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.29,0:08:57.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I fought ten of those\Nthings a while back.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fought ten of 'em?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.33,0:09:02.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NCome on, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.60,0:09:04.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me you at least tried to\Nfind something down there
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.53,0:09:06.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that we could actually use!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.12,0:09:10.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All you brought back was\Na bunch of scattered junk!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.62,0:09:13.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's not a single clue here\Nabout how to get to sky island!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There wasn't\Nanything there, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We looked.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, if there was something\Nelse down there,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we would've found it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ship was in terrible shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:26.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all jacked up like it had maybe\Nbeen attacked and raided.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.90,0:09:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps a mutiny\Nhad broken out
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they all killed each\Nother in a violent struggle
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.66,0:09:32.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for power and survival.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.63,0:09:46.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look around, boys!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.85,0:09:48.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why\Nwe need more information!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Intelligence means the\Ndifference between life
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and death for this whole crew
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and if we're going\Nto sail to sky island,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then we need\Ninformation to stay alive
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.95,0:09:58.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or whatever happened to that\Nship could happen to us too!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.86,0:10:00.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We didn't brave giant monsters\Nso you could bring back
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.91,0:10:04.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a creepy octopus, some rusty\Nswords, and a broken dish!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.12,0:10:05.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is all junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you're all idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NArmor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[crash]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.37,0:10:18.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! She crushed the armor!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.27,0:10:19.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, you didn't even\Nnotice the pretty sea shells
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.02,0:10:21.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I brought you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.37,0:10:23.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cram your sea shells\Nin your shorts!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.25,0:10:25.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful\Nwhen she's angry.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should still try\Nto keep your distance.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.40,0:10:31.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NBad day, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.48,0:10:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's only going to get\Nworse working with these guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.78,0:10:37.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll never figure out how\Nthat ship sailed to the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.54,0:10:39.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna snap on\Nthem any second.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.81,0:10:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NMaybe this'll help.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.63,0:10:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eternal Pose?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.80,0:10:44.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.80,0:10:47.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I took it off that\Nsalvager's ship earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:48.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:52.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.98,0:10:55.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the only one\NI can depend on!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.63,0:11:00.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right, who's up\Nfor an octopus dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.90,0:11:04.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That boy has got\Nto learn to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:10.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NJaya?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.39,0:11:12.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This must have\Nbeen their home port.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.40,0:11:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jaya? Is that where\Nwe're going next?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.86,0:11:17.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That would be your\Ndecision, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:23.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All hands, on deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Set our course to Jaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.80,0:11:31.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, uh, any of you know\Nwhich direction that might be?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.89,0:11:32.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NStarboard.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou heard her, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.56,0:11:35.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NRight!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.25,0:11:37.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOnward to Jaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:39.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now hold up just a minute.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we head off to this Jaya\Nplace that's so important,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:48.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,won't the Log Pose's needle\Nchange its position again?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.80,0:11:51.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\N'Cause if that happens,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.09,0:11:53.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we won't know which\Ndirection sky island is.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.05,0:11:53.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All hands, full stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.80,0:11:57.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wanna tell me why you're\Nmessing with my head Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.02,0:12:01.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the genius who\Ndecided we should go to Jaya.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.44,0:12:02.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't know\Nit was gonna ruin our plans
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.51,0:12:05.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to get to this Skypiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.64,0:12:07.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you have\Nthe memory of a goldfish.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.98,0:12:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think, the Log Pose has always\Nworked that way, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.56,0:12:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hey! Listen up!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.08,0:12:15.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have an important\Nannouncement to make!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:19.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seeing as I'm the captain, I say\Nwe set our course for Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.63,0:12:20.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you propose we get there?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.97,0:12:23.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to\Nask for some directions.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.21,0:12:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone in\NJaya will know the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well, Jaya it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:30.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! On to Jaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.13,0:12:32.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You already said that!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.50,0:12:33.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I doubt that the\Nneedle would change
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as soon as we get there.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.93,0:12:37.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So why don't we pull into port
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.34,0:12:39.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and then leave before it\Nhas a chance to adjust?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.89,0:12:40.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.59,0:12:42.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we're lucky, it'll work.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.34,0:12:45.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a plan to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.32,0:12:47.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NFull sail to Jaya, people!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And this time it's for real!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.06,0:12:52.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNow stop stuffing\Nyour faces and get to work!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI wonder\Nwhat this Jaya place is like.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.96,0:12:56.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope it's relaxing.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.25,0:12:57.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3651,5420,\1c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}[SANJI]\NNami my sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.25,0:12:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3651,5420,\1c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Robin my dear!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3651,5420,\1c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Dinner is served.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.79,0:13:10.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROSHIO]\NLooks like that's\Nthe last of your cash.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.88,0:13:12.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if you wanted to...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.67,0:13:14.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...I'd let you raise with, say
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:15.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,your clothes.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.63,0:13:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MEDDLER B]\NYou're lucky\Nand you don't even know it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.64,0:13:18.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MEDDLER A]\NPlaying with Roshio,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.51,0:13:20.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even if you would\Nhave won the hand,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.06,0:13:23.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,trust me, you would\Nhave lost something else.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.60,0:13:26.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROSHIO]\NI suppose\Nthat about wraps it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:29.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NDon't think so.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.87,0:13:32.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You cheated this entire hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.87,0:13:35.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never cheat.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.33,0:13:36.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a liar.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.58,0:13:37.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You lie.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.92,0:13:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I watched every\Ndeceitful move you made.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.92,0:13:43.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROSHIO]\NYou better watch you\Nmouth in this place, loser!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.56,0:13:45.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarquiss?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.27,0:13:47.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sarquiss!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.23,0:13:47.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SARQUISS]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.95,0:13:48.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NThis guy was cheating just now.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.08,0:13:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saw the whole\Nthing, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.84,0:13:55.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SARQUISS]\NYou bet I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every rotten little move.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.28,0:13:58.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He cheated straight through.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.95,0:14:00.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I say we do something\Nabout this guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.79,0:14:02.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make an example out of him.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.33,0:14:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no idea\Nwho you're dealing with!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:31.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.61,0:14:35.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see anything, Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.11,0:14:36.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.07,0:14:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just the sky and the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought that\NJaya Island wasn't too far
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.28,0:14:40.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from where we were.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.65,0:14:41.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.49,0:14:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And with the weather\Nbeing so clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.49,0:14:46.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should have spotted\Nthe coastline over an hour ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.11,0:14:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna like Jaya\Nif it's as warm as it is now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.00,0:14:51.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm finally getting\Nto work on my tan.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Spring weather's the best.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.08,0:14:59.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like the seagulls\Nare enjoying it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They've been shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be\Neating good tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.90,0:15:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think they could\Nhave been shot, Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear any gunfire.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.51,0:15:17.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found a bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:20.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And judging from the trajectory\Nit came from that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.22,0:15:21.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAre you saying the shots
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.18,0:15:23.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,came from an island we\Ncan't even see yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.85,0:15:25.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's impossible, Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.65,0:15:27.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I saw it happen\Nwith my own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:28.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.61,0:15:30.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A tuna had a better\Nchance at killing them.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No sniper or gun\Nhas that kind of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were probably shot before\Nand just happened to fall now.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:39.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Look! We found our dinner!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OGRE]\NPoor creature.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.35,0:15:48.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must have suffered.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.93,0:15:51.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to get an\Ninstant kill on one of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that's what\Nfate haled for him.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.96,0:15:56.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All the events of his life\Ndestined him to this outcome,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.66,0:15:59.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I can't blame myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.71,0:16:06.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BURGESS]\NHey, jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.99,0:16:08.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.92,0:16:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:11.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll tell ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the greatest fighting\Nchampion ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHaha! Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.82,0:16:22.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Check it out,\Nthis town looks great!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.36,0:16:25.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it just me or does this\Nplace look like a resort?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.09,0:16:26.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sure does!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and dock!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.09,0:16:29.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It does look promising.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.24,0:16:32.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can even\Nstay here awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:33.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NEither I'm\Nstarting to hallucinate
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.96,0:16:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or the harbor over there\Nis full of pirate ships.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NDon't be silly, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.62,0:16:45.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since when can pirates\Ndock their ships in a harbor
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.08,0:16:46.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,without being run out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:50.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP chuckles]\NYou're right. It must be a joke.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.55,0:16:51.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.42,0:16:54.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck's going\Non with this crazy town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:56.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BURGESS laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.81,0:16:59.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic little weakling!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.27,0:17:03.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DRUNK]\NHu‐ho! Mister you picked\Nthe wrong guy to beat up.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.47,0:17:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at that emblem.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.33,0:17:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's in Roshio's gang.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.37,0:17:09.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have heard of Roshio, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.17,0:17:13.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, the executioner whose\Nbounty is 42 million Berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:17.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The man is psychotic,\Nyou better watch your back!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER A]\NThat guy is full of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We watched that\Nentire game ourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.25,0:17:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one cheated.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe\Nhe was able
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.50,0:17:26.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to beat up Roshio so easily.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.46,0:17:28.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?\NThat's Bellamy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.34,0:17:30.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER B]\NWhat? That's Bellamy?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.18,0:17:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The one with the 55 million\Nbounty on his head?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.86,0:17:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.78,0:17:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.82,0:17:36.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who did this to him?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.95,0:17:38.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[UNDERLING B]\NWe need\Nto get him to a doctor! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.87,0:17:39.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[UNDERLING C]\NHang in there, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll get ya' fixed up!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.03,0:18:00.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now this looks\Nlike my kind of town.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.21,0:18:03.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWe'll have\Nno problem fitting in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.30,0:18:04.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.87,0:18:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think those\Ntwo can last an hour
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.51,0:18:08.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,without getting\Ninto any trouble?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.05,0:18:09.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, by the\Nlooks of this place,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.80,0:18:12.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd say 15 minutes\Nis a generous assumption.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.26,0:18:13.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:14.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd better save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:15.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:16.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy! Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.00,0:18:17.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:19.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:23.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NI'm sure she'll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with those two protecting her.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI'm the only\None who can protect Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NNot today!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.75,0:18:30.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami will be safe and\Nsound with Luffy and Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if you leave, then what\Nare we supposed to do
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.94,0:18:33.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(613.5,1053)}– if the ship is attacked?\N– Please don't leave!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna protect us?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.67,0:18:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll stay behind.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.15,0:18:37.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:38.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.44,0:18:41.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll whip up some tea\Nand hold down the fort then.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.36,0:18:42.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did Robin go?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.34,0:18:43.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.88,0:18:45.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.26,0:18:47.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSanji, about that tea.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.05,0:18:48.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NMake it yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.14,0:18:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got my tough face on\Nso if anybody messes with...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI]\NNo fighting! Promise me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.34,0:18:56.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.22,0:18:57.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.47,0:18:59.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good. This is serious\Nbusiness you two.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.72,0:19:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(850,1053)}– Good.\N– Great.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.14,0:19:03.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NGee, thanks for the support!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, if one of you\Ncauses trouble here,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll have to get\Nout of this town.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.05,0:19:08.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if that happens,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.30,0:19:10.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then we'll never know how to\Nget to the sky island, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:12.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:14.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa. He's messed up.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.52,0:19:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLooks like\Nhe fell off his horse.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat's gotta hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.93,0:19:21.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLooks like he's in pain too.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NNo doubt.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.14,0:19:25.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.90,0:19:27.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But will you help me up?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhat, are you not\Nin the mood to help yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.78,0:19:31.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy. Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:33.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Up you go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOC Q]\NHey, would ya look at that!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm on my horse again.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.01,0:19:42.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was a sickly child growing\Nup and never got better.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.38,0:19:45.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out\Nof here, Stronger.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.47,0:19:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUFFY, ZORO]\N– The horse too?\N– The horse too?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.14,0:19:50.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWe should put them\Nout of their misery.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.10,0:19:51.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOC Q]\NThanks again, pal.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.28,0:19:52.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya know I don't\Nhave enough money
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.88,0:19:54.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for a reward these days,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.33,0:19:56.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but care for an apple?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.40,0:19:57.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDo you take us for idiots?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.40,0:19:59.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd never trust food\Nfrom someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:01.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! Apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:04.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:07.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the? What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.19,0:20:08.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CLERK]\NSome guys\Ntook a few apples
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.40,0:20:09.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from that freak on the horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:13.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and when they bit into\Nthem, they exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Luffy! Spit it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.02,0:20:18.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Spit out the apple you just ate!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.64,0:20:21.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I already swallowed it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell'd you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:25.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.41,0:20:26.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The boy isn't hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.66,0:20:29.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN C]\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.74,0:20:32.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN D]\NI don't know,\Nbut the inside's destroyed.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.46,0:20:34.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOC Q]\NIf you had\Neaten the bad one,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.75,0:20:37.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you would have died\Non the first bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:41.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! You're lucky.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.60,0:20:45.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONLOOKER A]\NWhat is all this?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.09,0:20:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONLOOKER B]\NIt's Roshio's grave now.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.18,0:20:50.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONLOOKER A]\NIt looks like\Na war broke out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:53.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did they fire a cannon into\Nthe middle of town or something?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.39,0:20:54.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONLOOKER B]\NWho knows?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.56,0:20:56.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even the people who were\Nthere and saw what happened
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.66,0:20:59.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,said they couldn't tell\Nexactly what was going on.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.46,0:21:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100}About the only thing\Neveryone knows for certain
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is that Bellamy had\Nsomething to do with this.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.25,0:21:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONLOOKER A]\NBellamy the Hyena?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty obvious
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.26,0:21:10.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that he's using the power\Nof one of the devil's fruits.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.40,0:21:15.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhat's the deal with this town?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.41,0:21:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.11,0:21:17.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who really cares?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.74,0:21:18.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should care
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.78,0:21:21.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,seeing as you were\Nalmost killed for no reason.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well that was bound to\Nhappen sooner or later.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.84,0:21:25.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BURGESS roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:30.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.93,0:21:32.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh great, look who's back.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.18,0:21:34.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many victims\Nhas he racked up now?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.76,0:21:37.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN E]\NIt's not like he's\Na famous fugitive or anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.10,0:21:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you think he is?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.23,0:21:40.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care, and to be honest,\NI don't want to know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.02,0:21:43.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that meathead wants\Nto be the fighting champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:46.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then go ahead and let him.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fighting champion?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.81,0:21:51.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't even\Nthink about it you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.14,0:21:52.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.14,0:21:53.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to wonder
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.06,0:21:56.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if we can find any\Nuseful information here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.15,0:22:00.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHow about this place?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.74,0:22:03.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUh, seems pretty quiet to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.49,0:22:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.24,0:22:06.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This place is gorgeous!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.16,0:22:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To think such an oasis exists
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.45,0:22:11.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the middle of\Nthis disgusting town.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.50,0:22:12.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NIt's built above the water.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.50,0:22:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThat's great,\Nbut there's no one here.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.67,0:22:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Although I can smell\Nthat someone's cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.51,0:22:19.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.88,0:22:23.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! I'm gonna have to\Nask you all to leave please.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.23,0:22:25.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, the entire hotel has been\Nrented out by Mr. Bellamy
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.98,0:22:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and his guests,\Nand he's asked that we
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.16,0:22:29.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,tell other guests like\Nyourselves to go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.78,0:22:32.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, uh, you must understand that\NI have no say in the matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.70,0:22:34.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, one man rented\Nout this entire place?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.86,0:22:36.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If Mr. Bellamy sees you here,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.16,0:22:37.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he'll have my head\Nremoved from my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.91,0:22:40.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so please leave for my sake.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.56,0:22:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NC'mon, I'm sure he won't mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.52,0:22:44.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is this Bellamy anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.15,0:22:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SARQUISS]\NWhat's going on in here?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.28,0:22:49.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are these scumbags and what\Nare they doing in our hotel?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.41,0:22:50.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sarquiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:51.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.28,0:22:52.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told them to leave,\Nbut they won't listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.99,0:22:53.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I really don't care.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.77,0:22:54.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just get rid of them!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.97,0:22:57.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're paying a lot of money\Nto have this place to ourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.52,0:22:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.48,0:23:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now get out of here\Nbefore I throw you out.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.77,0:23:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, would you\Nmind if I beat him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:03.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.98,0:23:06.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! You're going to beat me up?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.78,0:23:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NHilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:10.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.68,0:23:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go buy some new rags so you\Ndon't look like an orphan.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.89,0:23:15.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LILY]\NSarquiss,\Nyou're wasting your money
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.27,0:23:17.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by tossing it to\Nthis bunch of losers.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.10,0:23:18.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SARQUISS]\NNo kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.31,0:23:20.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I should have just flushed it\Ndown along with my lunch.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.98,0:23:22.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take free money!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.04,0:23:23.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.36,0:23:24.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These jerks can't help us.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.98,0:23:27.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI can walk on my own, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.12,0:23:28.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:31.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[EDDY]\NSarquiss. Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:32.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just leave well enough alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.69,0:23:36.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SARQUISS]\NEddy,\Nwe've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.27,0:23:38.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know that\Ntrash you ran into?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.44,0:23:41.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems that they've been doing\Npretty well for themselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.35,0:23:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.27,0:23:43.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not bad,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.31,0:23:44.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but they're nothing compared\Nto you and Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:45.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.74,0:23:47.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But for ordinary scum\Nthey can hold their own.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.83,0:23:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They still don't stand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:51.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a chance of surviving the\Ntransition into the new era.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.79,0:23:52.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.89,0:23:56.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His bounty is 30 million,\Nfor such a little puke.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.98,0:24:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Bellamy\Nwill want to see this.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.57,0:24:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man, that really pisses me off!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.11,0:24:04.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TERRY]\NThat's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.23,0:24:05.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cause you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mock Town's economy depends\Non pirates throwing money around
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.03,0:24:10.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to show off power they\Nmay or may not have.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.36,0:24:13.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, so poor pirates aren't\Nallowed on the island?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.53,0:24:15.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's\Nno way of calming you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.95,0:24:18.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Here. This one's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:19.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.07,0:24:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TERRY]\NTough guys and degenerates
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.19,0:24:22.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are our clientele here,\Nso trouble isn't hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.99,0:24:25.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You aren't gonna make it in this\Ntown if ya let it bother ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.79,0:24:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to play it\Nsafe when you can.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.18,0:24:29.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.79,0:24:31.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This whole town's\Na real dump, ya know?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.00,0:24:34.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's how\Nmost level‐headed people
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,would think of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.02,0:24:35.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.98,0:24:38.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,level‐headed people\Nare rare in these parts.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.79,0:24:41.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The wanted posters won't be on\Nthe walls for a couple of days,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.38,0:24:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so you may want to skip town\Nsooner rather than later.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.97,0:24:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A couple days.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.05,0:24:48.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That doesn't give us much time.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.14,0:24:49.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now here's a question.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.09,0:24:50.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(515,1053)}– Hey, fatso!\N– [BLACKBEARD] Hey, barkeep!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.35,0:24:51.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TERRY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.30,0:24:52.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.51,0:24:53.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(505,1053)}– [BLACKBEARD] This cherry pie\N– [LUFFY] This cherry pie
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.74,0:24:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(607.5,1053)}– tastes friggin' delicious!\N– tastes friggin' horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.18,0:24:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(860,1053)}– Huh?\N– Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.35,0:25:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(693.5,1053)}– This is one of the\N– This is one of the
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.61,0:25:09.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(530.5,1053)}– worst drinks I've ever tasted!\N– best drinks I've ever tasted!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.89,0:25:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think there\Nmay be something wrong
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.42,0:25:13.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with your taste buds, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.05,0:25:16.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think there's somethin' wrong\Nwith your big fat head.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.09,0:25:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not\Nthe cook in this joint,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.93,0:25:19.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I don't care\Nwhat you have to say.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.85,0:25:21.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:24.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, barkeep!\NI'll take 50 steaks to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.23,0:25:27.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'll take 51 of those\Ndelicious cherry pies to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.56,0:25:29.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, make that 52 steaks!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.94,0:25:31.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NBetter make that 53 pies.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.64,0:25:33.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NFifty‐four steaks!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.10,0:25:34.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NFifty‐five pies!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.39,0:25:35.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSixty steaks!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.56,0:25:36.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NSeventy pies!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.60,0:25:37.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NEighty!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.22,0:25:38.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BLACKBEARD]\NA hundred!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.17,0:25:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat the\Nliving crap out of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you two even\Nhave the slightest idea
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.34,0:25:43.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what you're fighting about?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.25,0:25:45.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you promised, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.17,0:25:47.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, we don't have enough\Nmoney to buy dozens of steaks!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.95,0:25:49.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We aren't here to shop!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.87,0:25:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So then, are you a pirate?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.99,0:25:54.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.04,0:25:55.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How big's your bounty?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.44,0:25:57.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thirty million.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.42,0:26:00.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thirty million? For you?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.32,0:26:02.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't believe it\Neven if I collected it!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.56,0:26:04.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you calling me\Na liar you fat, hairy ape?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.98,0:26:05.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NEnough!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.19,0:26:07.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TERRY]\NWe've got rules in this place,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.57,0:26:09.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and one of 'em's no fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.34,0:26:13.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here's your 50 cherry pies.\NNow please, just walk away.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.20,0:26:35.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NI'm looking for a\Npirate that wears a straw hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.08,0:26:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER A]\NIt's Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.25,0:26:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you must\Nbe Straw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.42,0:26:47.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,worth a cool 30 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.38,0:26:48.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.38,0:26:50.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like he has a bone\Nto pick with you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That must be that Bellamy guy
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.12,0:26:54.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that rented out\Nthe hotel we were at.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.24,0:26:54.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.94,0:26:56.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The kid's worth 30 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.19,0:26:57.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER C]\NNo way.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.41,0:26:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER B]\NTell me about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.49,0:27:02.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come everyone\NI meet in this town is so tall?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.61,0:27:04.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take a glass\Nfrom the top shelf
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.69,0:27:07.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and give the kid\Nwhatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.61,0:27:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.90,0:27:11.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SARQUISS]\NLook at this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.20,0:27:13.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This joint is packed solid!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.74,0:27:15.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LILY]\NThis place is disgusting.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.12,0:27:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It smells like vomit.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.41,0:27:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[RIVERS]\NAll you can\Nget here is cheap rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.55,0:27:19.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, Zoro.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.25,0:27:21.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's those guys from earlier.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.27,0:27:24.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd be in a lot less pain
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.33,0:27:27.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you'd just offered\Nus your seats.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.00,0:27:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pathetic harbor trash.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.63,0:27:35.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER D]\NIt's him! "Big Knife" Sarquiss!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.34,0:27:38.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER E]\NHow much you wanna\Nbet he's looking for a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.30,0:27:40.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER D]\NOh great.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.44,0:27:41.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The whole gang is here.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.65,0:27:44.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way that they stopped\Nin just for a bite to eat.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.19,0:27:44.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drop it, man.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.90,0:27:46.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.07,0:27:49.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's Bellamy up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.03,0:27:50.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SARQUISS]\NThe usual fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.41,0:27:53.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NCheers.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.58,0:27:57.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hey, thanks for the drink, pal!\NYou know what? You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.60,0:28:08.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER F]\NHe did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.71,0:28:10.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.59,0:28:11.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brilliant move, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.92,0:28:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.05,0:28:14.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.59,0:28:17.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.05,0:28:18.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, punk?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.31,0:28:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat's the question\Nyou should be asking yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.57,0:28:28.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.27,0:28:30.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We still need to get\Nsome information from...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.23,0:28:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quiet! If this guy wants\Na fight, I'll give it to him.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.41,0:28:38.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NSo that's all\Nyou've got for backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.61,0:28:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.28,0:28:45.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, are you ready\Nto take me on or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.78,0:28:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.80,0:28:47.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER G]\NNo way!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.76,0:28:50.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The kid just challenged Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.81,0:28:53.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER I]\NHe'll be slaughtered!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.48,0:28:54.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.91,0:28:57.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong, kid.\NThis isn't a fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.43,0:28:58.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a test.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.33,0:29:00.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now come on.\NLet's see how strong you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.59,0:29:02.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.35,0:29:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mister, we're trying\Nto get to the sky island.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.63,0:29:07.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about that?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.60,0:29:14.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did she just say "sky island"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.72,0:29:15.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.41,0:29:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLike I was saying, if you\Nknow how to get to sky island...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.33,0:29:34.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.13,0:29:36.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did she say\Nwhat I think she said?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sky island? What an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:41.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.09,0:29:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can look at the\NLog Pose yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.72,0:29:45.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's pointed at the sky,\Nplain as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:46.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER I]\NHey, check it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.80,0:29:52.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do I look like the Log Pose now?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.18,0:29:55.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER J]\NNo one trusts\Nthose things anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.14,0:29:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They break if you breathe wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.56,0:29:58.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.73,0:30:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got me there, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.52,0:30:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you\Nguys are putting hope
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.73,0:30:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,into such a ridiculous legend\Nlike an island in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.16,0:30:09.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Especially considering\Nhow little you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.54,0:30:11.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like, of the thousands\Nof weird currents cutting
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.41,0:30:12.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,through the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.50,0:30:16.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,one of the weirdest is\Ncalled the Knock‐Up Stream.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.24,0:30:17.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like\Nthis is the first
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.87,0:30:19.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you've ever heard about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.84,0:30:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Any ship that gets caught\Nin the Knock‐Up Stream
Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.22,0:30:23.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is catapulted into the sky,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.88,0:30:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and later slams back\Ninto the ocean.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.85,0:30:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Years ago, a bunch\Nof ignorant sailors saw
Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.43,0:30:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ships falling from the sky
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.19,0:30:33.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and assumed there must be\Nan island up there somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.86,0:30:37.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In their minds, how else could\Na ship get up that high? Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.85,0:30:38.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:38.81,0:30:40.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything that seems supernatural
Dialogue: 50,0:30:40.40,0:30:42.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,always has a\Nrational explanation.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.65,0:30:45.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything a man can dream\Nwill eventually be explained,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.57,0:30:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and let me tell ya,\Nthe truth will hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.95,0:30:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.42,0:30:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.12,0:30:51.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was gonna let you join my crew
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.58,0:30:53.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you'd passed the\Ntest of the new era.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.50,0:30:57.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it seems like\Nyou're a lost cause.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.22,0:31:00.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thing is, the time of\Npirate's dreams are over!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.59,0:31:04.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold, the Emerald\NRuins, and the great One Piece!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.30,0:31:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fools who dream of\Nthese fictional treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:09.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,don't notice the real\Ntreasures that surround them!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.52,0:31:12.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In this age of oceans, the very\Nmen who are brave enough
Dialogue: 50,0:31:12.44,0:31:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and capable of\Nnavigating currents end up
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.73,0:31:18.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,chasing these ridiculous\Ndreams and die in the process!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.65,0:31:21.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whenever people speak of these\Ndead idiots they always say,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.61,0:31:24.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"He was happy because\Nhe died living his dreams."
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.33,0:31:25.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.12,0:31:28.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, he died because\Nhe was a fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:28.17,0:31:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So when I see people\Nchasing dreams of One Piece,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.17,0:31:33.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get disgusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:35.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.88,0:31:39.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY]\NYou're a weak pirate,\Njust like they were,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.68,0:31:42.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and as long as you're hacking\Naround, you'll make us,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.47,0:31:45.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the real pirates,\Nlook like trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.73,0:31:47.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER K chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.55,0:31:49.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out of here,\Nyou scrawny punk!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:49.62,0:31:51.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're killing our buzz!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.21,0:31:52.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:53.00,0:31:53.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get lost, you wimp!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:53.96,0:31:55.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CUSTOMER N]\NPut him in a body bag, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.55,0:31:56.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.01,0:31:57.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.16,0:31:59.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, give\Nthese people what they want!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tear into them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:02.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLAMY chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:32:02.53,0:32:04.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd be more than\Nhappy to entertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.71,0:32:06.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.80,0:32:07.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:08.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forget about all that\Npacifist crap I was talking
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.80,0:32:12.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about earlier and\Ntake this jerk out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.43,0:32:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NZoro.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.52,0:32:18.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Ndon't fight back.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=60}===============================DIALOGUE============================
